{
  "bookId": "hero-212001",
  "id": "bond-29313",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29313001",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "居然一刻不停地陪尤娜玩了一整天，稍微有点累……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29313002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "主人主人，我们去试试那个全自动搏击桩吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29313003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "事先说明，我可绝对不会输给主人哦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29313004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "话别说得太满，我也会全力以赴的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29313005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不过，尤娜一直充满活力的秘诀是什么呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29313006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "唔，因为博士的那瓶药水？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29313007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "喝下去以后，确实感觉身体里有用不完的活力。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29313008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "但是今天的话可不是这个答案。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "29313010",
              "text": "那……是什么？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "29313010",
              "text": "哦?"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "29313009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29313010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "因为你啦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29313011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "能和喜欢的主人一起闹腾，我可永远都停不下来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29313012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这么直接吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29313013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "没错，主人，我可是——非常喜欢你哦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29313014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "咳，我们走吧，尤娜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29313015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但事先说明，我也不会输。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29313016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "哦耶，一起加油吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
